{{Quote|Why bother with a cell? This human body is prison enough... But someday I'll be free. Then, they will all suffer, starting with [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]. Until that day... BRING ME [[Chili Fries|CHILI FRIES]]!|Albedo, while in prison.<ref name="GCBC">''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''</ref>}} 
'''Albedo'''{{Refn|In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Albedo's name was pronounced "Al-bee-do". From ''[[Trouble Helix]]'' onwards, it is pronounced "Al-bay-do".{{Refn|[[Contradictory Retcons (Classic)|Contradictory Retcons]]|group = BTP|name = retcon}}|group = note}} also known as '''Negative Ben''',{{Refn|group = credits|name = TFB1 credits}}<ref name="TFB1"/>{{Refn|group = credits|name = TFB2 credits}}<ref name="TFB2"/> is [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s former assistant, who, in his attempt to recreate the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]], turned himself into an imperfect clone of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]. Since then, he has been trying to get back to his [[Galvan (Classic)|Galvan]] form, while also harboring a great hatred and thirst for revenge for Ben Tennyson and Azmuth.

==Appearance==
===Human Form===
His first appearance is exactly the same as Ben's, but after his and Ben's [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] reacted to each other, it sent out a pulse that damaged his DNA and thus his form, inverting his colors. This made his hair white, his skin slightly paler, his eyes red, and turned the colors of his jacket from green with white stripes to red with black stripes, and his jeans from blue to dark grey. His T-shirt was white in ''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]'' and black in his remaining appearances in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''.

Albedo's human form has not changed much in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' though he now has dark circles under his eyes and paler skin. His jacket's design is mirrored, with the black stripe with a 0ᛚ now on his right side, along with additional pockets. His hair has grown longer. He wears the [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] on his right hand.

In ''[[The Ultimate Heist]]'', Albedo wore a red mirrored version of Ben's current T-shirt before changing into his older attire. While pretending to be Ben, he would wear a brunette wig and green contact lenses.

Beginning in ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', Albedo is transformed into an 11-year-old version of Ben. As such, he wears a red and black version of Ben's old shirt with grey pants, while still having his red eyes and white hair.

After he got arrested in ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', Albedo has a concrete guard on his right wrist, covering the Ultimatrix, and a shackle on his left leg.

===Galvan Form===
In ''[[Double or Nothing]]'', Albedo's Galvan form had red eyes, a red Galvan tunic with black stripes, pale skin without tendrils or wrinkles and fully open eyes.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Albedo's Galvan form has changed drastically in terms of appearance. His chin is stretched further down and visible tufts of hair now stick out of both eyes. Two smaller whiskers also stick out from Albedo's chin.  

In the flashback portion of ''[[Trouble Helix]]'', Albedo wears a robe/tunic with the Omnitrix symbol on it and metal on his legs, neck, and most of his arms. He had a normal Galvan face with green eyes. 

In the present, he looks like he did in ''Trouble Helix'', but the green is replaced by red and he has an [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his back.

===Transformations===
In ''Good Copy, Bad Copy'', Albedo's transformations were indistinguishable from Ben's.

In ''The Final Battle'', Albedo's transformations had red eyes and [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbols.

In '''Ultimate Alien''', Albedo's transformations were generally similar to how they were in ''The Final Battle'', though they now lack Ultimatrix symbols.

In '''Omniverse''', Albedo's transformations are similar to 16-year-old Ben Prime's, excluding his Galvan form. This time, their color schemes reflecting Albedo's own color scheme, being mostly red and/or paler. In some cases, they have a reverse pattern in their outfits.

