Albedo is incredibly intelligent, being "very smart even for a [[Galvan (Classic)|Galvan]]",{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = DM|name = link unavailable}} and has a large amount of knowledge about the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]], having been [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s assistant. He was able to create [[Omnitrix (Albedo's Replica)|a copy]] of the Omnitrix that, despite the mishap of turning him into a clone of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]], worked perfectly, as well as successfully complete the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] by integrating its energy core. Albedo created the [[Ultimate Forms|evolutionary function]] in the Ultimatrix. Technically speaking, he is smarter than [[Dr. Psychobos]].{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Smarter Than Psychobos.png]]|group = DJW}}

Albedo is a very good fighter,{{Refn|group = DVD|name = dvd}} as he could easily defeat [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] with just [[Swampfire]] and [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]] respectively. Albedo was able to easily overwhelm Ben in a hand-to-hand fight while both were human.<ref name="DoN" /> He was also able to take down tens of [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]] [[Bioid|clones]] with using only [[Ultimate Humungousaur]].<ref name="TFB2"/>

Thanks to a modification that Albedo made to himself through a [[Genetic Alteration Bomb|DNA altering machine]], Albedo can alter his DNA at will and change into any species without the need for an Omnitrix. As intended, Albedo also regained access to his true Galvan form. However, because Ben had interfered, whenever he changes into an alien form, he will always revert to his "Ben" form.<ref name="DoN" />

