Albedo originally had an Omnitrix he had built himself, giving him access to all of Ben's unlocked alien forms. However, his Omnitrix was of low quality and only worked by syncing data from Ben's Omnitrix, inadvertently causing him to assume Ben's form as it was the default. This Omnitrix was destroyed by Azmuth at the end of ''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''.

In ''[[The Final Battle: Part 1|The Final Battle]]'', Albedo used the Ultimatrix, a new version of the Omnitrix semi-completed by Azmuth and modified by himself. Unfortunately, at the time, it was connected to the same database as the Omnitrix, meaning Ben's form was still the default unless he could reset the Ultimatrix by gaining access to the Omnitrix. The Ultimatrix was later taken from him by Ben.<ref name="TFB2"/>

Prior to ''[[The Ultimate Heist]]'', Albedo created a [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|stabilization device]], which allowed him to better control his DNA altering and stay in his Galvan form for longer. Though it was initially disguised as a replica of the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|second Omnitrix]], Albedo eventually stole a [[Polymorphic Crystal]] from [[Thirteen]]'s collection, and used it to enhance the device, turning it into a second Ultimatrix. This upgrade gave him the ability to transform into Ultimate forms again, most notably an [[Ultimate Galvan]] form. It was eventually disabled by Azmuth.<ref name="MG" />

