====[[Ben 10 Alien Force: Vilgax Attacks]]====
Albedo appears as a boss on [[MorOtesi]] tricking [[Cooper (Classic)|Cooper]] into making an energy core from [[Taydenite]]. All of his aliens' eyes and Omnitrix symbol are red. After defeating him in his Humungousaur form (when he has no health left), instead of simply falling over, he'll appear to be selecting another alien form to use, something that he doesn't do (even if the player doesn't hit him at this point). When battling him, he always seems to exclude one move out of his alien's movesets.

The player can mirror-match him by using the same alien form he does and revert back to Ben when he reverts if they so desire, but doing so is not strategically worthwhile, especially in the DS version as he always attacks Ben after taking a hit, which can result in a war of attrition where less skilled players are guaranteed to take damage, if not outright lose. The player will also not have access to every alien form either except via entering a password on consoles or a rematch on DS.

In the DS version, after he is defeated, he attempts to use [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]], but gets locked in an argument with [[Serena]] and [[Bellicus]]. After the game is beaten, there is a post-credits cutscene where he is attempting to leave Alien X while Bellicus and Serena bring up an old argument. Once he is beaten on Hero Mode, he becomes an alternate skin in the DS version of the game, though his attacks have a weaker damage output than Ben and he takes twice the damage Ben normally does from enemy and boss attacks.

