==Etymology==
Albedo was named after the reflectivity of a celestial body.{{Refn|[[:File:Azmuth Etymology.PNG]]|group = DM}} Albedo is a "reflection" of Ben.

==Trivia==
*When Albedo was working for [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] in creating the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]], he worked on the Omnitrix's software package.{{Refn|[[:File:Myaxx Designed DNA Collection Devices.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*Just like [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]], Albedo likes [[Chili Fries|chili fries]], but not because of Ben's DNA. Albedo is just blaming it on Ben.{{Refn|group = DM|name = link unavailable}}
**Albedo likes smoothies too, but he can control himself around those.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Likes Smoothies.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Albedo's human form is not albino. It is just a coincidence that he was given white hair and pale skin.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo is Not Albino.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*Albedo considers his 11-year-old human form to be a lot worse than his 15/16-year-old form.<ref name="FaFBM" />
*When Albedo lies, his left eye twitches, just like Ben's.<ref name="GCBC">''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''</ref>
*Albedo's regular transformations were credited with the "Negative" prefix in '''Ultimate Alien'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Night of the Living Nightmare Voice Credits.png]]|group = credits}}<ref>''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''</ref> This is no longer the case in '''Omniverse''', and [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] was unaware that Albedo's aliens were credited as such until 2020.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Was Unaware of Negative Alien Credits.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Due to him transforming without the need of an Omnitrix, Albedo is not able to add more aliens to his roster.{{Refn|[[:File: Albedo Cannot Add More Aliens.png]]|group = DJW|name = add}} He only received the ability to transform into species that were available in the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] as of ''[[Double or Nothing]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:Feedback's DNA Not in Alteration Field.PNG]]|group = DJW|name=FB}}
**Therefore, he does not have some of Ben's more recently added DNA samples such as [[Feedback]],{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Doesn't Have Feedback.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|group = DJW|name=FB}} [[Walkatrout]], [[Pesky Dust]], [[Mole-Stache]], [[The Worst]],{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Does Not Have Outbreak Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}} [[Kickin' Hawk]], and [[Whampire]].
**However, Derrick later stated that his explanation of Albedo only having every alien available to Ben prior to ''Double or Nothing'' does not work because of the existence of Negative [[Gravattack]], which made him unsure of Albedo's current roster.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Retracted Double or Nothing Statement.png]]|group = DJW}}
***This contradiction, however, can be explained away if it is inferred that Gravattack was unlocked in the [[Ultimatrix]] as of ''Double or Nothing'', only that Ben was unaware of it until ''[[A Jolt From the Past]]''.
* In 2020, Derrick made artwork of Negative [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]],{{Refn|[[:File:OV Negative Alien X Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} Negative [[Ball Weevil]],{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Ball Weevil Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} Negative Walkatrout,{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Walkatrout Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} Negative Pesky Dust,{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Pesky Dust Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} Negative [[Bullfrag]],{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Bullfrag Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} Negative [[Atomix]],{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Atomix Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} and Negative [[Alien Z]].{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Alien Z Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} However, as none of these aliens were available in the original Ultimatrix during ''Double or Nothing'', it is unlikely that Albedo can officially transform into them.
*There is an alternate timeline where Albedo turned into Negative Alien X and was stuck motionless for nearly a year.<ref name=Paradox/><ref name=B10KR/>
**Albedo's Bellicus and Serena would be red and named Annikus and Kursika.{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Serena and Bellicus.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Albedo's role in the [[Mad World]], Bad Timeline, Nega Timeline, Benzarro's Timeline, [[Dimension 23]], and [[Gweniverse]] is unknown, since Derrick believed that Albedo did not exist in other realities, or at least did not exist as a villain or a being with powers.{{Refn|[[:File:Only One Albedo in the Multiverse.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Despite this, there is a version of Albedo who transformed into Alien X and was stuck motionless for nearly a year,<ref name=Paradox/><ref name=B10KR/> which contradicts Derrick's statement about alternate Albedos.
*Albedo's powers at the end of ''Double or Nothing'' are similar to [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]]'s powers after he absorbed the Omnitrix for the first time.
*Albedo's existence was first hinted by [[Dwayne McDuffie]] on September 8, 2008, who teased a villain with an [[Omnitrix]] would appear in the series.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Existence Hint.png]]|group = DM}}
*In ''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]'', Albedo and his aliens were originally supposed to be colored slightly off-palette.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/c/c1/Good_Copy%2C_Bad_Copy_Script_As_Broadcast.pdf ''Good Copy, Bad Copy'' Script As Broadcast]|group = script}}
*Albedo was originally supposed to appear in '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens|Destroy All Aliens]]''''', serving the same role [[Azmuth's Father|Azmuth's father]] did in the final version of the movie.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/9/97/DAA_Script_Revised_Final_Draft_Pgs_85_to_89.pdf '''''Ben 10: Alien Dimensions''''' Script Revised Final Draft]|group = script}}
*In ''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction|Cosmic Destruction]]'', when Albedo as Evil Way Big crash-lands on the moon, and turns back to normal, his appearance is from ''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''.
*Various Albedo action figures erroneously depict him with a green Omnitrix or Ultimatrix. This error also appeared in ''[[Punch Time Explosion XL]]''.
*A design resembling a young version of Albedo can be seen as an alternative skin for Young Ben in the game [[Punch Time Explosion]] with the same general colors that would be used in '''Omniverse''' years later.
*Albedo is [[Charlotte McDuffie]]'s favorite '''[[Ben 10 (Franchise)|Ben 10]]''' character.{{Refn|[[:File:Charlotte McDuffie's Favorite Character.png]]|group = CM}}
*Derrick doubted that Albedo will ever reform.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Opinion on Albedo.png]]|group = DJW}}

